# # /tkgpv/
#
# https://w3id.org/tkgpv/ redirects to https://github.com/damsolanke/tkgpv
#
# TKG-PV: a bitemporal, evidence-aware ontology for temporal reasoning in
# pharmacovigilance knowledge graphs. The ontology will be published in that
# repository after the NIH "It's About Time" challenge Phase 1 closes
# (15 January 2027); until then every path under /tkgpv/ goes to the repository.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Dam Solanke
# GitHub username: damsolanke

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://github.com/damsolanke/tkgpv [R=302,L]
